PN,38901
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1785383018
OL,3,CMaternity departments at two Sussex
OL,4,Chospitals re-rated as requires
OL,5,Cimprovement
OL,7,FThe Care Quality Commission (CQC) has
OL,8,Fre-rated the maternity departments at
OL,9,FPrincess Royal Hospital and St
OL,10,FRichard's Hospital, both run by
OL,11,FUniversity Hospitals Sussex NHS
OL,12,FFoundation Trust as requires
OL,13,Fimprovement, following inspections
OL,14,Fcarried out between October and
OL,15,FDecember last year.
OL,17,FIssues raised included the assessment
OL,18,Fof women, with staff not able to see
OL,19,Fclearly those waiting and employees
OL,20,Ffeeling burnt out and not always
OL,21,Flistened to.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/14
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1785383018
OL,3,CMaternity departments at two Sussex
OL,4,Chospitals re-rated as requires
OL,5,Cimprovement
OL,7,FUniversity Hospitals Sussex Trust have
OL,8,Fsaid that, since the inspection, they
OL,9,Fhave increased theatre capacity and
OL,10,Fstaffing levels.
OL,12,FAmanda Williams, CQC deputy director
OL,13,Fof hospitals, secondary and specialist
OL,14,Fcare for the South-East, said:
OL,16,F"When we inspected maternity services
OL,17,Fat St Richard's Hospital and Princess
OL,18,FRoyal Hospital, it was encouraging to
OL,19,Fhear women and their loved ones
OL,20,Fconsistently describe staff as kind,
OL,21,Fcaring and professional.
OL,26,@xD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/14
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1785383018
OL,3,CMaternity departments at two Sussex
OL,4,Chospitals re-rated as requires
OL,5,Cimprovement
OL,7,F"Women told us they felt involved in
OL,8,Fdecisions about their care.
OL,10,F"Their feedback reflected the
OL,11,Fdedication and compassion shown by
OL,12,Fstaff every day, with many describing
OL,13,Fpositive experiences throughout their
OL,14,Fmaternity journey.
OL,16,F"We also saw strong support for
OL,17,Ffamilies experiencing bereavement and
OL,18,Ffor women with mental health needs.
OL,26,@xD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/14
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1785383018
OL,3,CMaternity departments at two Sussex
OL,4,Chospitals re-rated as requires
OL,5,Cimprovement
OL,7,F"Specialist midwives were available
OL,8,Ffor as long as families needed them,
OL,9,Fincluding during future pregnancies.
OL,11,F"Partners were also well supported,
OL,12,Fwith the trust scoring well above the
OL,13,Fnational average for involving them
OL,14,Fduring labour and throughout a
OL,15,Fhospital stay.
OL,17,F"However, our inspections also found
OL,18,Fongoing pressures that were affecting
OL,19,Fwomen's experiences.
OL,26,@yD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/14
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1785383018
OL,3,CMaternity departments at two Sussex
OL,4,Chospitals re-rated as requires
OL,5,Cimprovement
OL,7,F"At both hospitals, women weren't
OL,8,Falways seen within 15 minutes of
OL,9,Farriving at the maternity assessment
OL,10,Funit.
OL,12,F"Medical reviews didn't always happen
OL,13,Fquickly enough and at St Richard's
OL,14,FHospital, staff were unable to clearly
OL,15,Fsee women waiting in the maternity
OL,16,Fassessment unit,
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/14
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1785383018
OL,3,CMaternity departments at two Sussex
OL,4,Chospitals re-rated as requires
OL,5,Cimprovement
OL,7,F"At Princess Royal Hospital, equipment
OL,8,Ffailures regularly forced the
OL,9,Fmaternity operating theatre to close,
OL,10,Fcausing delays to planned caesarean
OL,11,Fsections and increasing anxiety for
OL,12,Fwomen waiting for treatment.
OL,14,F"This sometimes caused women to be
OL,15,Fmoved through public areas affecting
OL,16,Ftheir privacy and dignity.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/14
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1785383018
OL,3,CMaternity departments at two Sussex
OL,4,Chospitals re-rated as requires
OL,5,Cimprovement
OL,7,F"We were also concerned to hear staff
OL,8,Fat Princess Royal describe feeling
OL,9,Ftired and burnt out, with some saying
OL,10,Ftheir concerns about staffing weren't
OL,11,Falways being listened to.
OL,13,F"Staff have valuable information that
OL,14,Fcan improve women's care, and leaders
OL,15,Fshould use it to drive improvement.
OL,17,F"Leaders understand where improvements
OL,18,Fare needed and have plans in place to
OL,19,Faddress these issues.
OL,26,@oD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/14
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1785383018
OL,3,CMaternity departments at two Sussex
OL,4,Chospitals re-rated as requires
OL,5,Cimprovement
OL,7,F"Staff should be proud of the care
OL,8,Fthey continue to provide under
OL,9,Fsignificant pressure, and we will
OL,10,Fcontinue to monitor both services
OL,11,Fclosely to ensure women and their
OL,12,Fbabies remain safe while improvements
OL,13,Fare made."
OL,15,FAt St Richard's Hospital, inspectors
OL,16,Ffound staff were unable to clearly see
OL,17,Fwomen waiting in the maternity
OL,18,Fassessment unit, making it harder to
OL,19,Fidentify and respond promptly if
OL,20,Fsomeone's condition was deteriorating.
OL,26,@uD@JO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G8/14
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38909
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1785383018
OL,3,CMaternity departments at two Sussex
OL,4,Chospitals re-rated as requires
OL,5,Cimprovement
OL,7,FThe trust hadn't ensured women on the
OL,8,Fpostnatal ward received pain relief
OL,9,Fand other medicines in a timely way,
OL,10,Fwith staffing pressures and ward
OL,11,Fdelays contributing to longer waits.
OL,13,FLeaders hadn't provided a bereavement
OL,14,Fsuite that was fully separated from
OL,15,Flabour ward activity, meaning families
OL,16,Fwho'd lost a baby could still hear
OL,17,Fsounds from other parts of the ward.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G9/14
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38910
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1785383018
OL,3,CMaternity departments at two Sussex
OL,4,Chospitals re-rated as requires
OL,5,Cimprovement
OL,7,FAt Princess Royal Hospital, inspectors
OL,8,Ffound the trust wasn't consistently
OL,9,Fproviding an environment that
OL,10,Fprotected women's privacy and dignity
OL,11,Fwhen the main theatre was unavailable,
OL,12,Frequiring staff to move women through
OL,13,Fpublic corridors and lifts.
OL,15,FThe trust wasn't ensuring all women
OL,16,Freceived timely access to early
OL,17,Fmaternity care, with nearly a third
OL,18,Fnot having their first midwife
OL,19,Fappointment before 10 weeks of
OL,20,Fpregnancy.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G10/14
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38911
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1785383018
OL,3,CMaternity departments at two Sussex
OL,4,Chospitals re-rated as requires
OL,5,Cimprovement
OL,7,FLeaders hadn't provided sufficient
OL,8,Faccess to antenatal education, with
OL,9,Fclasses limited to in-person weekend
OL,10,Fsessions and restricted availability,
OL,11,Fmaking it harder for women and their
OL,12,Fpartners to prepare for birth.
OL,14,FCQC refers to women, but recognises
OL,15,Fand respects that some transgender
OL,16,Fmen, non-binary people and people with
OL,17,Fvariations in sex characteristics or
OL,18,Fwho are intersex may also use
OL,19,Fmaternity services and experience some
OL,20,Fof the same issues.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G11/14
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38912
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1785383018
OL,3,CMaternity departments at two Sussex
OL,4,Chospitals re-rated as requires
OL,5,Cimprovement
OL,7,FGail Byrne, Interim Chief Nurse at
OL,8,FUniversity Hospitals Sussex, said: "We
OL,9,Fwelcome these findings, particularly
OL,10,Fthe positive feedback from women and
OL,11,Ftheir loved ones, and the inspectors'
OL,12,Frecognition of our maternity teams'
OL,13,Fcompassion and dedication to their
OL,14,Fwork.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G12/14
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38913
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1785383018
OL,3,CMaternity departments at two Sussex
OL,4,Chospitals re-rated as requires
OL,5,Cimprovement
OL,7,F"We also fully accept their conclusion
OL,8,Fthat further improvement is needed and
OL,9,Fare committed to addressing these
OL,10,Fissues urgently. Since the inspection,
OL,11,Fwe have increased theatre capacity and
OL,12,Fstaffing levels, strengthened how we
OL,13,Fcollect and monitor key safety
OL,14,Finformation, and reviewed and updated
OL,15,Fpolicies and clinical guidance.
OL,26,@oD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G13/14
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38914
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1785383018
OL,3,CMaternity departments at two Sussex
OL,4,Chospitals re-rated as requires
OL,5,Cimprovement
OL,7,F"However, we know there is much more
OL,8,Fto do. Listening to women and
OL,9,Ffamilies, learning from their
OL,10,Fexperiences and acting on what they
OL,11,Ftell us will remain at the heart of
OL,12,Four commitment to providing the safe,
OL,13,Fcompassionate and high-quality care
OL,14,Fevery family deserves.'
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G14/14
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
